// Title: File Decoded From Base64/Hex Via Certutil.EXE
// Sigma ID: cc9cbe82-7bc0-4ef5-bc23-bbfb83947be7
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Jonhnathan Ribeiro, oscd.community
// Date: 2023-02-15 | Modified: 2025-06-04
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1027
// Description: Detects the execution of certutil with either the "decode" or "decodehex" flags to decode base64
//   or hex encoded files. This can be abused by attackers to decode an encoded payload before
//   execution
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/certutil
//   - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/new-babyshark-malware-targets-u-s-national-security-think-tanks/
//   - https://news.sophos.com/en-us/2021/04/13/compromised-exchange-server-hosting-cryptojacker-targeting-other-exchange-servers/
//   - https://twitter.com/JohnLaTwC/status/835149808817991680
//   - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/archive/blogs/pki/basic-crl-checking-with-certutil
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Certutil/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_certutil_decode.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\certutil.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "CertUtil.exe") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "-decode " or ProcessCommandLine contains "/decode " or ProcessCommandLine contains "–decode " or ProcessCommandLine contains "—decode " or ProcessCommandLine contains "―decode " or ProcessCommandLine contains "-decodehex " or ProcessCommandLine contains "/decodehex " or ProcessCommandLine contains "–decodehex " or ProcessCommandLine contains "—decodehex " or ProcessCommandLine contains "―decodehex ")
